            "Call this at the start of every iteration to see the current state, "
            "and after writing a fix to verify it worked. "
            "Returns exit_code=0 and passed=true when all tests pass — that is the done condition. "
            "Do NOT call this repeatedly with no file changes between calls."
        ),
        "input_schema": {
